  unitName: Galvanic Belle Lafiel
  unitId: 40696
  unitNumber: 1247
  description: Upon venturing into Elgaia, she encountered another goddess. Not long
    after, she came to understand that this goddess was opposed to her protection
    of humans, and that the same goddess had been behind her conflicts with other
    gods. However, the battle between the two goddesses ended as soon as it began.
    The goddesses were not simply antithetical to each other, their powers were also
    identical in scope. Flung apart, both goddesses' bodies went on to benefit another
    world, although neither desired this outcome.
  summonDesc: '[[Malbelle|She]] is my reason for being.<br>And she is my antithesis...<br>Meeting
    her was my end.'
  fusionDesc: They are foolish at times,<br>but people are capable of<br>boundless
    kindness.<br>I love you.
  evoDesc: Having learned the reason<br>behind my own divinity,<br>I shall evolve...
  element: 4
  rarity: 6
